Usage: cardano-cli dijkstra transaction sub-transaction 
                                                          ( build-raw
                                                          | sign
                                                          | txid
                                                          )
                                                          

  Sub-transaction commands. A sub-transaction is built and signed on its own,
  then embedded in a top-level transaction.

Available options:
  -h,--help                Show this help text

Available commands:
  build-raw                Build an unsigned sub-transaction (low-level, inconvenient)

                           Please note the order[93;22;23;24m of some cmd options is crucial. If used incorrectly may produce undesired sub-transaction body. See nested [] notation above for details.[0;22;23;24m
  sign                     Sign a sub-transaction
  txid                     Print a sub-transaction identifier.
